{
  "about": [
    "Wiki articles on the two clients (criterion 10, mocks 11–16): the category directory, a topic's article with",
    "its footnotes and entries, Browse by category and the A–Z index — the words, the orders and the readings the",
    "web phone and iOS must share. The web reads this file in `lib/wikiArticles.test.ts`; OrbitKit in",
    "`WikiArticlesCopyParityTests` (`WikiArticleCopy`, `WikiArticleLogic`), so the two ends cannot drift.",
    "",
    "`orders`: the home page's bands top to bottom on a phone, an article page's sections, the directory's",
    "first rows, Browse's and the index's sections. `directory`: the server's directory read → the groups the",
    "directory lists (a category with no topic left out, uncategorized topics last under `Other`, a topic's",
    "count the entries its article was written from, null before it has one). `browse`: the same read → the",
    "lines Browse says. `index`: the index read's items → the letters and rows, Chinese titles by pinyin",
    "(`initials` pins the characters the old boundary string got wrong: 六 is L, 入 is R). `updated`: an",
    "article's head line, in `timeZone`. `segments`: a sentence's runs. `articleGroups`: an article's entries",
    "by kind, the cited ones leading their group in footnote order, the rest newest first."
  ],
